ing walk took her past the school garden.","example_zh":"她慣常的晨間散步會經過校園花園。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/habitual-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-hamstring-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"hamstring","sort_order":1,"sense":"阻撓","alt_zh":"高中團隊與成年老師在未完成模型旁查看不足木材，暫停並討論調整，無人體傷害。","example":"A shortage of materials could hamstring the restoration project.","example_zh":"材料短缺可能阻撓修復專案。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/hamstring-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-harbinger-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"harbinger","sort_order":1,"sense":"預兆","alt_zh":"高中生與成年自然老師在安全花園欣賞枝頭初開花朵，遠處仍有冬季景色。","example":"The first blossoms were a harbinger of spring.","example_zh":"最初花朵是春天將至的預兆。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/harbinger-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-harmonious-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"harmonious","sort_order":1,"sense":"和諧的","alt_zh":"高中生與成年園丁從平緩小徑欣賞樹、花圃與長椅平衡協調的花園。","example":"The harmonious arrangement of trees and paths made the garden peaceful.","example_zh":"樹木與步道和諧配置，讓花園寧靜。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/harmonious-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-haughty-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"haughty","sort_order":1,"sense":"傲慢的","alt_zh":"高中舞臺劇中一位成年虛構藝術評論者抬頭抱臂，新手拿作品等待，導演引導反思，無羞辱字句。","example":"The haughty character refused to listen to the beginners.","example_zh":"傲慢角色拒絕聆聽新手。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/haughty-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-hectic-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"hectic","sort_order":1,"sense":"繁忙的","alt_zh":"成年活動主辦人與高中志工在校園禮堂有序搬書箱、布置舞臺與準備樂器。","example":"The hectic morning involved deliveries, rehearsals, and a final inspection.","example_zh":"忙碌早晨包括收貨、排練與最後檢查。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/hectic-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-hefty-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"hefty","sort_order":1,"sense":"大量的；沉重的","alt_zh":"兩位成年志工使用穩固推車搬運大書箱，高中生在旁協助開門，無不安全負重。","example":"The volunteers carried a hefty box of donated books together.","example_zh":"志工一起搬一大箱捐贈書籍。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/hefty-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-hoard-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"hoard","sort_order":1,"sense":"囤積","alt_zh":"高中生看故事插畫，一位成年角色面對過量倉存、社區志工邀請分享，無實際囤積建議。","example":"The story warned against the urge to hoard supplies while others went without.","example_zh":"故事告誡不要在別人缺乏物資時囤積用品。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/hoard-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-idyllic-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"idyllic","sort_order":1,"sense":"田園般的","alt_zh":"高中參訪團與成年嚮導從安全木橋欣賞寧靜村莊、綠田與清溪。","example":"The idyllic village lay beside a clear stream.","example_zh":"田園般村莊坐落清澈溪流旁。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/idyllic-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-illicit-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"illicit","sort_order":1,"sense":"非法的","alt_zh":"成年博物館員與警員在辦公室查看文物照片與封存文件，無交易方法或武器。","example":"The museum investigated the illicit sale of a stolen artifact.","example_zh":"博物館調查被盜文物的非法交易。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/illicit-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-immaculate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"immaculate","sort_order":1,"sense":"完美的；潔淨無瑕的","alt_zh":"高中生與成年老師在非常乾淨整齊的手作工坊查看分類有序的工具架。","example":"The immaculate workshop had every tool in its place.","example_zh":"一塵不染工坊中，每件工具都在固定位置。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/immaculate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-imminent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"imminent","sort_order":1,"sense":"迫在眉睫的","alt_zh":"成年嚮導與高中隊伍從安全步道看遠方濃雲，正走向近處穩固遊客中心。","example":"The dark clouds suggested that rain was imminent.","example_zh":"烏雲顯示雨就要來了。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/imminent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-impede-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"impede","sort_order":1,"sense":"阻礙","alt_zh":"成年園丁與高中志工在安全花園入口看到一根橫擋步道的倒枝，準備改道。","example":"The fallen branch could impede access to the garden.","example_zh":"倒枝可能阻礙進入花園。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/impede-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-implicate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"implicate","sort_order":1,"sense":"牽連","alt_zh":"成年調查員與律師在辦公室比較無字文件與組織圖，無真實人物或未證實指控。","example":"The new documents could implicate another official in the scandal.","example_zh":"新文件可能牽連另一位官員涉入醜聞。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/implicate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-impoverished-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"impoverished","sort_order":1,"sense":"貧困的","alt_zh":"成年慈善志工與高中生在簡樸整潔鄉村圖書室有尊嚴地整理新捐書籍。","example":"The charity supplied book