:"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/inept-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-inert-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"inert","sort_order":1,"sense":"惰性的","alt_zh":"成年化學老師向高中生展示封閉教學樣本與簡單分子模型，無混合實驗或配方。","example":"The chemistry lesson compared inert materials with more reactive ones.","example_zh":"化學課比較惰性材料與較活潑材料。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/inert-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-infatuated-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"infatuated","sort_order":1,"sense":"迷戀的","alt_zh":"高中生在天文館興奮研究太空服展示與行星模型，成年老師在旁。","example":"The student was infatuated with the idea of becoming an astronaut.","example_zh":"那位學生對成為太空人的想法十分著迷。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/infatuated-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-inflame-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"inflame","sort_order":1,"sense":"激怒；激化","alt_zh":"虛構成年會議成員因可疑文件提高聲量，成年主持人平靜請大家先查證，無辱罵文字或暴力。","example":"The false accusation began to inflame the argument.","example_zh":"不實指控開始激化爭論。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/inflame-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-ingenuity-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"ingenuity","sort_order":1,"sense":"創造力","alt_zh":"高中生向成年老師展示回收瓶與低壓細管做成的安全滴灌盆栽模型。","example":"The student's ingenuity turned spare parts into a useful watering device.","example_zh":"學生的創造力把備用零件變成實用澆水裝置。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/ingenuity-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-innocuous-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"innocuous","sort_order":1,"sense":