rd-illustrations/senior/instigate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-insurmountable-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"insurmountable","sort_order":1,"sense":"無法克服的","alt_zh":"高中團隊與成年老師把大量圖書分類任務分成幾個小區，重新振作開始工作。","example":"The huge task seemed insurmountable until we divided it into smaller steps.","example_zh":"龐大任務原本看似無法克服，直到我們拆成小步驟。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/insurmountable-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-intangible-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"intangible","sort_order":1,"sense":"無形的","alt_zh":"高中生與成年社區志工完成花園後互相微笑握手，神情自信親近。","example":"The project gave us intangible benefits such as trust and confidence.","example_zh":"專案帶來信任與信心等無形益處。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/intangible-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-irate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"irate","sort_order":1,"sense":"憤怒的","alt_zh":"成年遊客在博物館櫃臺原本皺眉，成年館員耐心說明、遞上行程圖卡，無衝突。","example":"The irate visitor calmed down after the staff explained the delay.","example_zh":"憤怒訪客在工作人員說明延誤後平靜下來。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/irate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-irreversible-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"irreversible","sort_order":1,"sense":"不可逆的","alt_zh":"成年陶藝老師在安全教室向高中生並排展示柔軟未燒陶土與完成冷卻的堅硬陶杯，無窯爐操作。","example":"Baking the clay caused an irreversible change.","example_zh":"陶土燒製後產生不可逆變化。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/irreversible-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-juxtapose-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"juxtapose","sort_order":1,"sense":"並列","alt_zh":"高中訪客在博物館同一展桌比較